### TradeGrind API Request Collection (RFC 2616 / REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8009/api
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1

###

### 2. Register New Customer (Virtual Balance: ₹10,00,000)
# @name registerCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Aarav Sharma",
  "email": "aarav.trader@tradegrind.in",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "CUSTOMER"
}

###

### 3. Register New Company (Creates Linked Stock)
# @name registerCompany
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Vikram Sethi",
  "email": "vikram@novatech.sim",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "COMPANY",
  "companyName": "Nova Technologies Ltd",
  "sector": "Information Technology",
  "symbol": "NOVA",
  "initialPrice": 1200.00,
  "mu": 0.14,
  "sigma": 0.22
}

###

### 4. Login as Demo Customer (Pre-seeded)
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "trader@tradegrind.in",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Store Customer Token
@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.data.token}}

###

### 5. Login as Demo Company (Infosys Limited)
# @name loginCompany
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "ceo@infy.sim",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Store Company Token
@companyToken = {{loginCompany.response.body.data.token}}

###

### 6. Get Current Authenticated Profile (Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### 7. Get Current Authenticated Profile (Company with populated stock)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

###

### 8. Access Company-Only Endpoint as Company (Expects 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/company/my-stock HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

###

### 9. Access Company-Only Endpoint as Customer (Expects 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/company/my-stock HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### 10. Access Protected Endpoint without Token (Expects 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1

###

### 11. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
